#: scenario:scenario_3DEE7AD6_107A_4537_8E81_568624737ADD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ef0f2b858d793123aed0d0ef40cf3eac3b52510718430ba03d41c04023136f5a
#. default-sha256: 50f00db28147610ac7822f31c011ee4b4085be40de00743a04a7f06e7f3b27b2
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_3DEE7AD6_107A_4537_8E81_568624737ADD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Now, now, Nellie.⟪k:1⟫You love the theatre, so don’t look so cross."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Suvvia, Nellie.⟪k:1⟫Tu ami il teatro, non essere così arrabbiata."

#: scenario:scenario_265CFEC0_5E71_47F9_B9A3_6E01D0CC0A2E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fcc46da29df543b110da9a9e6a6a5a8b0d592f130389f857090fde0e57ab8d27
#. default-sha256: 770439cf1ffcc7e92486f32fb31d3833da322b9540dc68659a3fc2577a1b55fe
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_265CFEC0_5E71_47F9_B9A3_6E01D0CC0A2E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Hmph."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Hmf."

#: scenario:scenario_2F0690F5_B04D_499F_B67D_F42C33A29F63
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fb8a24ebbb7df09ffcd948557c6c078a57542a775b2f8732f91064a0317a963c
#. default-sha256: 2f43a8afa3f969fcbf17aacfabe8c4020b2f9d7d984e86c1c43011672710c5aa
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_2F0690F5_B04D_499F_B67D_F42C33A29F63"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Nellie was out with a man other than her brother that evening—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫a rare sight indeed. "
"⟪k:3⟫And she was quite clearly in a foul mood."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Quella sera, Nellie era fuori in compagnia di un uomo diverso da suo fratello—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫un "
"evento raro, non c’è che dire.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Ed era chiaramente di cattivo umore."

#: scenario:scenario_65760D68_8157_4380_A1FD_C7D9499A5EE6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8aef9c20f225e910e8873b3ddb7774222dda7373afecf5c4e925909ffefc3150
#. default-sha256: 8f9627adef687637f37f64b74f06ba92513131e3bc8204a4cd9743c394eff35a
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_65760D68_8157_4380_A1FD_C7D9499A5EE6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫(I will ⟪k:1⟫not⟪k:2⟫ stand for this...⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫That I should have to marry a man as "
"disagreeable as Arthur!⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫It’s unthinkable!)"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫(⟪k:1⟫Non accetto⟪k:2⟫ che io debba sposare un uomo antipatico come Arthur!⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫"
"È⟪k:6⟫ impensabile!)"

#: scenario:scenario_B3289336_18B3_49E0_B92B_E9704C56BF7C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 41b1c73659af6d8ba40dfd827f72669aa6733a929de2af38124c20a9041ea0c6
#. default-sha256: 815ee730019eb2e3817f6c41058599d73577c3bb4915c976ff65dd2f484fa7fd
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_B3289336_18B3_49E0_B92B_E9704C56BF7C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The young man at her side was Nellie’s fiancé, selected by her parents."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Il giovane al suo fianco era il fidanzato di Nellie, selezionato dai suoi genitori."

#: scenario:scenario_2F332995_B0A8_4013_B749_FE106936CB7E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9b9925ed48c6f4ee7a97d66d00a5adc007f7447b0bcd0f8bd27d9b065ef2ed27
#. default-sha256: 53ed185f4527b8e55f33328a08f789b39bb936a93fcc7f6ce9eeaf35b717d5cb
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_2F332995_B0A8_4013_B749_FE106936CB7E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫On any other occasion, she would have snubbed an invitation from any man who was not Mell, "
"but she had little say in this matter."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫In qualunque altra occasione, avrebbe snobbato un invito da qualsiasi uomo che non fosse "
"Mell, ma stavolta lei non ebbe alcuna voce in capitolo."

#: scenario:scenario_7B4E434A_609F_4B9C_A5EE_816B096EBA14
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 60b6ba22c13921147ea264b7e0faf646c705c05b790c68cb3f157c7946e11904
#. default-sha256: b04e935a66036016602984899b50a3449deb7f789d4cdf94a85a58258295a626
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_7B4E434A_609F_4B9C_A5EE_816B096EBA14"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫She was, for lack of a better word, ⟪k:1⟫forced⟪k:2⟫ to go out with him."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫In mancanza di una parola migliore, era stata ⟪k:1⟫costretta⟪k:2⟫ a uscire con lui."

#: scenario:scenario_981EEAD6_A7DA_43EC_8AED_E0D04DBBEEB9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dd5f0351cd1c2f3e6156609b865db965d287965fc95187801b25aa7b123e95f6
#. default-sha256: ed27d59ea9d7446da6e850ac5db844e9ed534b1a4a9d82b1c2648861eb9974f3
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_981EEAD6_A7DA_43EC_8AED_E0D04DBBEEB9"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And oh, how furiously she had fought against it."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Oh, e con quanta furia aveva lottato contro tale decisione."

#: scenario:scenario_A3769533_FCFB_4D4E_85A6_56B7C5565642
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5467765d4c2535196d506ec8b9ef924e1d4be00511dffff0994802d93d22ab22
#. default-sha256: b919d913b5ee7ae11449d3219424fd67955720b9a87680596a0d39635862d75c
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_A3769533_FCFB_4D4E_85A6_56B7C5565642"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She had shoved aside the abigail trying to fasten her corset, locked herself in her room, "
"and sobbed for quite some time."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Dopo aver spinto da parte l’ancella che cercava di allacciarle il corsetto, si era chiusa "
"nella sua stanza, singhiozzando per diverso tempo."

#: scenario:scenario_1B9656D9_5A1E_4E60_B4B2_337DB9F43FF7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0e2bcd94c1d7d82442d01d879f51883265004b683ccbf54d356011693b8a8c62
#. default-sha256: 3f14ffd1546095ef16b84826f51d09673f71c937b7420960aaeb60f1157c02de
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_1B9656D9_5A1E_4E60_B4B2_337DB9F43FF7"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It required the combined efforts of several of us to get her ready and out the door for her "
"date."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Furono richiesti gli sforzi congiunti di molti di noi per prepararla e mandarla al suo "
"appuntamento."

#: scenario:scenario_078FE7B8_6C56_4766_8BED_7CF3038AAEF0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 465089ab5ab34182024f960cf9065c5634b44c4111ad5cdf58996253f05709f1
#. default-sha256: 16e247abb58a5f73e24ccc319c3b4011e50132fc351fd12b88b595b66e9e0d13
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_078FE7B8_6C56_4766_8BED_7CF3038AAEF0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Come now, you should at least ⟪k:4⟫pretend⟪k:5⟫ you’re enjoying yourself.⟪k:6⟫"
"⟪k:7⟫Or do you want people to think we don’t get along?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Dai, potresti quantomeno far ⟪k:4⟫finta⟪k:5⟫ di divertirti.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫O vuoi "
"che la gente pensi che non andiamo d’accordo?"

#: scenario:scenario_24B6A010_ADAA_4375_8A4F_BE6D161702D7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f4ed9cd9cf0925acd125075612f3adfa04ce730cff8dd05d09ff46d8a34a13de
#. default-sha256: 4093ab0b6d9baa6be96c23bebf67de66f95827e77f50fb5e3315fb12c379eff0
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_24B6A010_ADAA_4375_8A4F_BE6D161702D7"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Do⟪k:3⟫ we get along?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Perché, ⟪k:2⟫andiamo d’accordo⟪k:3⟫?"

#: scenario:scenario_150145E6_1717_40BB_B084_B1238714E878
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c3db43bd326cb4bb27d890d4af0d7a9e4f871b38b8832dd866cecc6dc7fc904b
#. default-sha256: ec327e2a5b38297fe38884b42fb87d9ba1dbc4e2d97a7a209192dbfd09e18962
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_150145E6_1717_40BB_B084_B1238714E878"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Well... ⟪k:3⟫I want to, for what it’s worth."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Beh... ⟪k:3⟫io lo vorrei, per quello che vale."

#: scenario:scenario_247AAE0A_3603_4E14_AEB6_5526CAE6D447
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d866754a44fdfa29d72fe2c47d084c6bc940f2454deed91e2bcbb3a780491db9
#. default-sha256: 18ed1f21f7297d73541a3a8a526a7dee1e0c588a1ee5cf34ded3ac9fd8aea1b7
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_247AAE0A_3603_4E14_AEB6_5526CAE6D447"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫What it’s “worth” to you is my ⟪k:2⟫name⟪k:3⟫, not me."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Quello che “vale” per te è il mio ⟪k:2⟫nome⟪k:3⟫, non io."

#: scenario:scenario_D633889E_04E6_4147_BE25_F57BD22D608F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2292b05c624825edd58bc09709ef2b3c6a8ec0a6477e958d538361ce361dc01e
#. default-sha256: fc0ac31ad962cf0273679a6ea450773052c870ba6a334087dd86817f90bb9fb1
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_D633889E_04E6_4147_BE25_F57BD22D608F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Are you really going to be like that?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I went out of my way to take you to "
"your favorite play.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫The least you could do is be a little kinder to me."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Hai davvero intenzione di startene così tutta la sera?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Ho fatto di tutto "
"per portarti al tuo spettacolo preferito.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Il minimo che potresti fare è essere un po’ "
"più gentile con me."

#: scenario:scenario_F0AEB14C_70D5_4B18_8AD9_F79F58B6C9C8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e393afdc577bd90b594bd155b0c22a7773d2ef32b70da8ceda18b1c43feadc94
#. default-sha256: bcc16f523c3bad918bad7bb76c671f370bc76e247c1294cf8b7a21b8c970b0d8
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_F0AEB14C_70D5_4B18_8AD9_F79F58B6C9C8"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫What was it called again... ⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Romeo and Juliet⟪k:3⟫?⟪k:4⟫It’s been running for six "
"or seven years now."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Com’è che si chiama... ⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Romeo e Giulietta⟪k:3⟫?⟪k:4⟫Lo stanno dando da sei o sette "
"anni ormai."

#: scenario:scenario_6BA47F48_0529_4CCA_AD27_7CADA721BB07
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ced2ea7c1dc62aba586fe8bf13417d97bd3d068fb40c94c4212d3146b43f9d8a
#. default-sha256: cfecc4813fb282a2bd471476dea1518e5503acc9710e5d1e16226c4a442096d9
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_6BA47F48_0529_4CCA_AD27_7CADA721BB07"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫A family like yours or mine could pay to have a brand new script written."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Una famiglia come la tua o la mia potrebbe pagare per far scrivere una nuova storia."

#: scenario:scenario_30713950_AE46_4D34_9ECA_C74882F16FDE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1569a162a473b40da6d01532f20d012790c515afb4261525550aa10f4d372e10
#. default-sha256: 615beebe948e60f07ec4ba0bad71080599b054abbe833021f86ec84098a89b95
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_30713950_AE46_4D34_9ECA_C74882F16FDE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫So why should we have to see an old play at a theatre full of ⟪k:1⟫commoners⟪k:2⟫? ⟪k:3⟫It "
"may be private, but even so... ⟪k:4⟫Haah... ⟪k:5⟫I would rather just have a show put on at my "
"estate—"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Allora perché dovremmo vedere una vecchia recita in un teatro pieno di ⟪k:1⟫gente "
"comune⟪k:2⟫? ⟪k:3⟫Può anche essere privato, ma in ogni caso... ⟪k:4⟫Haah... ⟪k:5⟫Preferirei "
"semplicemente far mettere in scena uno spettacolo nella mia tenuta—"

#: scenario:scenario_3D9E56C0_A1B7_44EC_AD7A_FB63A51C5339
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6ab5f289fe3c146b8244d480f5dadd78a4eb977dfcf35972221ac02b2f25371c
#. default-sha256: 1bef02378ac328432bb62f2c6ac910cd4cba5ea3145efab752e023e444c8db23
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_3D9E56C0_A1B7_44EC_AD7A_FB63A51C5339"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Stop talking already!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Sta’ zitto per una buona volta!"

#: scenario:scenario_F8B95437_8DF9_4401_923C_9F25D9E5F7D5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8779b96b97ccc25450c852a6b3a1030575bb2cdc8e7e81bf088c28682cf5ac86
#. default-sha256: d4f806d9890730e66e8e65ca35c31d93f534f76b42f6693a95011b5e7eee5f1e
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_F8B95437_8DF9_4401_923C_9F25D9E5F7D5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Why should I— ⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Why should I have to marry someone like you?!⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫I have "
"ab-⟪k:6⟫so-⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫lutely⟪k:9⟫ no desire to marry you!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Perché dovrei— ⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Perché dovrei sposare uno come te?!⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Non ho a⟪k:6⟫"
"sso⟪k:7⟫lu⟪k:8⟫ta⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫mente⟪k:11⟫ alcuna intenzione di sposarti!"

#: scenario:scenario_D09A1D64_2C74_4796_8952_7D1C3A7D3431
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1d09d78e247db7c56c2c429ebcc38a9c47c29b7fa02d53425fa331c66aa1a00e
#. default-sha256: 0d5e23cb7a2c61ccefd6429f2126af66a14388f8542ae2213761632978905ae0
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_D09A1D64_2C74_4796_8952_7D1C3A7D3431"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Whatever it takes, I ⟪k:1⟫will⟪k:2⟫ put a stop to this!⟪k:3⟫I’ll talk to Father as many "
"times as I must!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Metterò fine a tutto questo in qualunque modo!⟪k:1⟫Parlerò con mio padre tutte le volte che "
"serve!"

#: scenario:scenario_BD0D5A62_3C7D_4C7E_91EB_857CAB409587
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2bdf776773946f046a3eab99425c50b59b5c24fe5315f3bb2124ff05687b6a28
#. default-sha256: 90230a6c4018d58994082223ae148f11957a4627265e940a1d4c57e9652e71f3
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_BD0D5A62_3C7D_4C7E_91EB_857CAB409587"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Please, don’t make such a scene. It’s shameful.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫There are people around; "
"remember, you represent your family."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Per favore, non fare questa scenata. ⟪k:3⟫È⟪k:4⟫ vergognoso.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Abbiamo "
"delle persone intorno; ⟪k:7⟫ricorda, tu rappresenti la tua famiglia."

#: scenario:scenario_406485EF_FA15_4EBC_8C65_EE46A5C1DA53
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
